xDicePerLine": null, "longTextFontSize": null}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 222682368, "text": "Try playing with more people", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 222682164, "text": null, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 282, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 0, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Try playing with more people. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">You will need a dictionary and paper and pens/pencils for all the players.</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Player 1 finds a real word in the dicitonary (but one with a meaning the others probably don't know). </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Player 1 reads the word.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">The other players write their own fake definitions of the word. While they are writing, Player 1 copies the real definition onto their own piece of paper.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Everyone passes their definitions to Player 1. </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Player 1 reads out all the definitions (including the real one).</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">The other players must take it in turns to guess which was the real definition.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">After everyone has guessed, reveal which was the real defintion!</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Players get one point if they guessed the real definition and one point for every other player who guessed their definition. Player 1 gets one point if nobody guessed the real definition. </span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Repeat the game so that each person has a turn at being Player 1 and choosing a word from the dictionary.</span></li>\n</ol>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 282, "name": "Fictionary (more than two players)", "logCreatedAt": "2023-12-06T11:41:14.814951", "logUpdatedAt": "2023-12-06T11:41:14.814951", "logCreatedById": 21670528, "logUpdatedById": 21670528, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 6, "btnType": "SECONDARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName